---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="closing" data-bg="#0b0b0b" data-ink="#e6e5e1" data-chapter="dark">
  <div class="closing__notes">
    <span>语录版权归原作者，本页只做短引用并附出处。</span>
    <span>内容以 Markdown 存在仓库里，一篇文章一个文件。</span>
  </div>

  <a
    class="closing__link"
    href="https://github.com/gotorion/Wisdom"
    rel="noopener">gotorion.github.io/Wisdom</a
  >

  <div class="closing__meta">
    <span>{year} · BeHappy</span>
    <span>
      <a href={`${base}/`}>回到开头</a>
    </span>
  </div>
</footer>
